tulis sebagai kode program.", "hold": 0.6, "start": 11.912, "speech": 12.312, "audio": 8.812, "dur": 10.113, "words": [["Lalu,", 0.4, 0.713], ["pada", 0.775, 1.025], ["dua", 1.087, 1.275], ["puluh", 1.337, 1.65], ["November", 1.712, 2.212], ["dua", 2.275, 2.462], ["ribu", 2.525, 2.775], ["dua", 2.837, 3.025], ["puluh", 3.087, 3.4], ["enam,", 3.462, 3.775], ["muncul", 3.837, 4.213], ["sebuah", 4.275, 4.65], ["bukti", 4.713, 5.025], ["yang", 5.088, 5.338], ["tidak", 5.4, 5.713], ["ditulis", 5.775, 6.213], ["di", 6.275, 6.4], ["kertas,", 6.463, 6.9], ["tetapi", 6.963, 7.338], ["ditulis", 7.4, 7.838], ["sebagai", 7.9, 8.338], ["kode", 8.4, 8.65], ["program.", 8.713, 9.213]]}, {"id": "b0_4", "seg": 0, "scene": "b0", "text": "Kalau ditulis dalam bentuk yang bisa dibaca manusia, menurut perkiraan seorang matematikawan, panjangnya lebih dari dua ratus lima puluh ribu halaman!", "hold": 0.8, "start": 22.025, "speech": 22.425, "audio": 9.375, "dur": 10.875, "words": [["Kalau", 0.4, 0.713], ["ditulis", 0.775, 1.212], ["dalam", 1.275, 1.587], ["bentuk", 1.65, 2.025], ["yang", 2.087, 2.337], ["bisa", 2.4, 2.65], ["dibaca", 2.712, 3.087], ["manusia,", 3.15, 3.65], ["menurut", 3.712, 4.15], ["perkiraan", 4.213, 4.775], ["seorang", 4.838, 5.275], ["matematikawan,", 5.338, 6.213], ["panjangnya", 6.275, 6.9], ["lebih", 6.963, 7.275], ["dari", 7.338, 7.588], ["dua", 7.65, 7.838], ["ratus", 7.9, 8.213], ["lima", 8.275, 8.525], ["puluh", 8.588, 8.9], ["ribu", 8.963, 9.213], ["halaman!", 9.275, 9.775]]}, {"id": "b0_5", "seg": 0, "scene": "b0", "text": "Tidak ada manusia yang sanggup membaca semuanya, tetapi komputer bisa memeriksa setiap barisnya.", "hold": 0.6, "start": 32.9, "speech": 33.3, "audio": 6.0, "dur": 7.3, "words": [["Tidak", 0.4, 0.713], ["ada", 0.775, 0.963], ["manusia", 1.025, 1.462], ["yang", 1.525, 1.775], ["sanggup", 1.837, 2.275], ["membaca", 2.337, 2.775], ["semuanya,", 2.837, 3.4], ["tetapi", 3.462, 3.837], ["komputer", 3.9, 4.4], ["bisa", 4.463, 4.713], ["memeriksa", 4.775, 5.338], ["setiap", 5.4, 5.775], ["barisnya.", 5.838, 6.4]]}, {"id": "b0_6", "seg": 0, "scene": "b0", "text": "Di video ini, kamu akan melihat bagaimana AI dan komputer sampai ke titik ini, dan apakah kita sudah boleh mempercayainya.", "hold": 3.5, "start": 40.2, "speech": 40.6, "audio": 7.625, "dur": 11.825, "words": [["Di", 0.4, 0.525], ["video", 0.588, 0.9], ["ini,", 0.963, 1.212], ["kamu", 1.275, 1.525], ["akan", 1.587, 1.837], ["melihat", 1.9, 2.337], ["bagaimana", 2.4, 2.962], ["AI", 3.025, 3.15], ["dan", 3.212, 3.4], ["komputer", 3.462, 3.962], ["sampai", 4.025, 4.4], ["ke", 4.463, 4.588], ["titik", 4.65, 4.963], ["ini,", 5.025, 5.275], ["dan", 5.338, 5.525], ["apakah", 5.588, 5.963], ["kita", 6.025, 6.275], ["sudah", 6.338, 6.65], ["boleh", 6.713, 7.025], ["mempercayainya.", 7.088, 8.025]]}, {"id": "b1_1", "seg": 1, "scene": "b1", "text": "Bilangan prima adalah bilangan yang hanya bisa dibagi oleh satu dan oleh dirinya sendiri, seperti dua, tiga, lima, tujuh, dan sebelas.", "hold": 1.5, "lead": 1.2, "start": 52.025, "speech": 53.225, "audio": 8.375, "dur": 11.375, "words": [["Bilangan", 1.2, 1.7], ["prima", 1.762, 2.075], ["adalah", 2.138, 2.513], ["bilangan", 2.575, 3.075], ["yang", 3.138, 3.388], ["hanya", 3.45, 3.763], ["bisa", 3.825, 4.075], ["dibagi", 4.138, 4.513], ["oleh", 4.575, 4.825], ["satu", 4.888, 5.138], ["dan", 5.2, 5.388], ["oleh", 5.45, 5.7], ["dirinya", 5.763, 6.2], ["sendiri,", 6.263, 6.763], ["seperti", 6.825, 7.263], ["dua,", 7.325, 7.575], ["tiga,", 7.638, 7.95], ["lima,", 8.012, 8.325], ["tujuh,", 8.387, 8.762], ["dan", 8.825, 9.012], ["sebelas.", 9.075, 9.575]]}, {"id": "b1_2", "seg": 1, "scene": "b1", "text": "Kalau kita lihat dari dekat, letak bilangan prima tampak acak dan sulit ditebak.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 63.4, "speech": 63.8, "audio": 5.0, "dur": 6.7, "words": [["Kalau", 0.4, 0.713], ["kita", 0.775, 1.025], ["lihat", 1.087, 1.4], ["dari", 1.462, 1.712], ["dekat,", 1.775, 2.15], ["letak", 2.212, 2.525], ["bilangan", 2.587, 3.087], ["prima", 3.15, 3.462], ["tampak", 3.525, 3.9], ["acak", 3.962, 4.213], ["dan", 4.275, 4.463], ["sulit", 4.525, 4.838], ["ditebak.", 4.9, 5.4]]}, {"id": "b1_3", "seg": 1, "scene": "b1", "text": "Namun, kalau kita hitung berapa banyak bilangan prima sampai angka tertentu, muncul pola yang mengejutkan.", "hold": 2.0, "start": 70.1, "speech": 70.5, "audio": 6.625, "dur": 9.325, "words": [["Namun,", 0.4, 0.775], ["kalau", 0.838, 1.15], ["kita", 1.212, 1.462], ["hitung", 1.525, 1.9], ["berapa", 1.962, 2.337], ["banyak", 2.4, 2.775], ["bilangan", 2.837, 3.337], ["prima", 3.4, 3.712], ["sampai", 3.775, 4.15], ["angka", 4.213, 4.525], ["tertentu,", 4.588, 5.15], ["muncul", 5.213, 5.588], ["pola", 5.65, 5.9], ["yang", 5.963, 6.213], ["mengejutkan.", 6.275, 7.025]]}, {"id": "b1_4", "seg": 1, "scene": "b1", "text": "Pada tahun seribu delapan ratus lima puluh sembilan, Bernhard Riemann menemukan bahwa rahasia bilangan prima tersimpan di sebuah fungsi yang sekarang kita sebut fungsi zeta.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 79.425, "speech": 79.825, "audio": 10.812, "dur": 12.513, "words": [["Pada", 0.4, 0.65], ["tahun", 0.713, 1.025], ["seribu", 1.087, 1.462], ["delapan", 1.525, 1.962], ["ratus", 2.025, 2.337], ["lima", 2.4, 2.65], ["puluh", 2.712, 3.025], ["sembilan,", 3.087, 3.65], ["Bernhard", 3.712, 4.213], ["Riemann", 4.275, 4.713], ["menemukan", 4.775, 5.338], ["bahwa", 5.4, 5.713], ["rahasia", 5.775, 6.213], ["bilangan", 6.275, 6.775], ["prima", 6.838, 7.15], ["tersimpan", 7.213, 7.775], ["di", 7.838, 7.963], ["sebuah", 8.025, 8.4], ["fungsi", 8.463, 8.838], ["yang", 8.9, 9.15], ["sekarang", 9.213, 9.713], ["kita", 9.775, 10.025], ["sebut", 10.088, 10.4], ["fungsi", 10.463, 10.838], ["zeta.", 10.9, 11.213]]}, {"id": "b1_5", "seg": 1, "scene": "b1", "text": "Fungsi ini menerima bilangan kompleks, yaitu titik pada sebuah bidang, dan mengeluarkan titik lain.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 91.938, "speech": 92.338, "audio": 6.188, "dur": 7.888, "words": [["Fungsi", 0.4, 0.775], ["ini", 0.838, 1.025], ["menerima", 1.087, 1.587], ["bilangan", 1.65, 2.15], ["kompleks,", 2.212, 2.775], ["yaitu", 2.837, 3.15], ["titik", 3.212, 3.525], ["pada", 3.587, 3.837], ["sebuah", 3.9, 4.275], ["bidang,", 4.338, 4.775], ["dan", 4.838, 5.025], ["mengeluarkan", 5.088, 5.838], ["titik", 5.9, 6.213], ["lain.", 6.275, 6.588]]}, {"id": "b1_6", "seg": 1, "scene": "b1", "text": "Ada titik-titik khusus yang membuat hasil fungsi zeta menjadi nol, dan titik-titik inilah yang disebut nol zeta.", "hold": 1.5, "start": 99.826, "speech": 100.226, "audio": 7.0, "dur": 9.2, "words": [["Ada", 0.4, 0.588], ["titik-titik", 0.65, 1.337], ["khusus", 1.4, 1.775], ["yang", 1.837, 2.087], ["membuat", 2.15, 2.587], ["hasil", 2.65, 2.962], ["fungsi", 3.025, 3.4], ["zeta", 3.462, 3.712], ["menjadi", 3.775, 4.213], ["nol,", 4.275, 4.525], ["dan", 4.588, 4.775], ["titik-titik", 4.838, 5.525], ["inilah", 5.588, 5.963], ["yang", 6.025, 6.275], ["disebut", 6.338, 6.775], ["nol", 6.838, 7.025], ["zeta.", 7.088, 7.4]]}, {"id": "b1_7", "seg": 1, "scene": "b1", "text": "Riemann menduga bahwa semua nol yang penting terletak di satu garis lurus, yaitu garis dengan bagian real setengah.", "hold": 1.5, "start": 109.026, "speech": 109.426, "audio": 7.188, "dur": 9.387, "words": [["Riemann", 0.4, 0.838], ["menduga", 0.9, 1.337], ["bahwa", 1.4, 1.712], ["semua", 1.775, 2.087], ["nol", 2.15, 2.337], ["yang", 2.4, 2.65], ["penting", 2.712, 3.15], ["terletak", 3.212, 3.712], ["di", 3.775, 3.9], ["satu", 3.962, 4.213], ["garis", 4.275, 4.588], ["lurus,", 4.65, 5.025], ["yaitu", 5.088, 5.4], ["garis", 5.463, 5.775], ["dengan", 5.838, 6.213], ["bagian", 6.275, 6.65], ["real", 6.713, 6.963], ["setengah.", 7.025, 7.588]]}, {"id": "b1_8", "seg": 1, "scene": "b1", "text": "Dugaan inilah yang disebut Hipotesis Riemann.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 118.413, "speech": 118.813, "audio": 2.812, "dur": 4.512, "words": [["Dugaan", 0.4, 0.775], ["inilah", 0.838, 1.212], ["yang", 1.275, 1.525], ["disebut", 1.587, 2.025], ["Hipotesis", 2.087, 2.65], ["Riemann.", 2.712, 3.212]]}, {"id": "b1_9", "seg": 1, "scene": "b1", "text": "Kenapa penting? Karena setiap nol zeta seperti satu nada, dan kalau semua nada itu dijumlahkan, hasilnya adalah tangga bilangan prima yang persis.", "hold": 4.0, "start": 122.925, "speech": 123.325, "audio": 9.125, "dur": 13.825, "words": [["Kenapa", 0.4, 0.775], ["penting?", 0.838, 1.337], ["Karena", 1.4, 1.775], ["setiap", 1.837, 2.212], ["nol", 2.275, 2.462], ["zeta", 2.525, 2.775], ["seperti", 2.837, 3.275], ["satu", 3.337, 3.587], ["nada,", 3.65, 3.962], ["dan", 4.025, 4.213], ["kalau", 4.275, 4.588], ["semua", 4.65, 4.963], ["nada", 5.025, 5.275], ["itu", 5.338, 5.525], ["dijumlahkan,", 5.588, 6.338], ["hasilnya", 6.4, 6.9], ["adalah", 6.963, 7.338], ["tangga", 7.4, 7.775], ["bilangan", 7.838, 8.338], ["prima", 8.4, 8.713], ["yang", 8.775, 9.025], ["persis.", 9.088, 9.525]]}, {"id": "b1_10", "seg": 1, "scene": "b1", "text": "Jadi, kalau hipotesis ini benar, kita tahu bahwa ketidakteraturan bilangan prima punya batas yang rapi.", "hold": 3.5, "start": 136.75, "speech": 137.15, "audio": 6.438, "dur": 10.637, "words": [["Jadi,", 0.4, 0.713], ["kalau", 0.775, 1.087], ["hipotesis", 1.15, 1.712], ["ini", 1.775, 1.962], ["benar,", 2.025, 2.4], ["kita", 2.462, 2.712], ["tahu", 2.775, 3.025], ["bahwa", 3.087, 3.4], ["ketidakteraturan", 3.462, 4.463], ["bilangan", 4.525, 5.025], ["prima", 5.088, 5.4], ["punya", 5.463, 5.775], ["batas", 5.838, 6.15], ["yang", 6.213, 6.463], ["rapi.", 6.525, 6.838]]}, {"id": "b2_1", "seg": 2, "scene": "b2", "text": "Sebelum ada AI, komputer sudah lama ikut berburu nol zeta.", "hold": 0.6, "lead": 1.2, "start": 147.387, "speech": 148.587, "audio": 3.625, "dur": 5.725, "words": [["Sebelum", 1.2, 1.637], ["ada", 1.7, 1.887], ["AI,", 1.95, 2.138], ["komputer", 2.2, 2.7], ["sudah", 2.763, 3.075], ["lama", 3.138, 3.388], ["ikut", 3.45, 3.7], ["berburu", 3.763, 4.2], ["nol", 4.263, 4.45], ["zeta.", 4.513, 4.825]]}, {"id": "b2_2", "seg": 2, "scene": "b2", "text": "Pada awal tahun seribu sembilan ratus lima puluhan, Alan Turing memakai salah satu komputer pertama untuk memeriksa lebih dari seribu nol zeta.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 153.112, "speech": 153.512, "audio": 8.938, "dur": 10.638, "words": [["Pada", 0.4, 0.65], ["awal", 0.713, 0.963], ["tahun", 1.025, 1.337], ["seribu", 1.4, 1.775], ["sembilan", 1.837, 2.337], ["ratus", 2.4, 2.712], ["lima", 2.775, 3.025], ["puluhan,", 3.087, 3.587], ["Alan", 3.65, 3.9], ["Turing", 3.962, 4.338], ["memakai", 4.4, 4.838], ["salah", 4.9, 5.213], ["satu", 5.275, 5.525], ["komputer", 5.588, 6.088], ["pertama", 6.15, 6.588], ["untuk", 6.65, 6.963], ["memeriksa", 7.025, 7.588], ["lebih", 7.65, 7.963], ["dari", 8.025, 8.275], ["seribu", 8.338, 8.713], ["nol", 8.775, 8.963], ["zeta.", 9.025, 9.338]]}, {"id": "b2_3", "seg": 2, "scene": "b2", "text": "Sekarang, komputer modern sudah memeriksa lebih dari dua belas triliun nol, dan semuanya berada tepat di garis setengah.", "hold": 1.5, "start": 163.75, "speech": 164.15, "audio": 7.5, "dur": 9.7, "words": [["Sekarang,", 0.4, 0.963], ["komputer", 1.025, 1.525], ["modern", 1.587, 1.962], ["sudah", 2.025, 2.337], ["memeriksa", 2.4, 2.962], ["lebih", 3.025, 3.337], ["dari", 3.4, 3.65], ["dua", 3.712, 3.9], ["belas", 3.962, 4.275], ["triliun", 4.338, 4.775], ["nol,", 4.838, 5.088], ["dan", 5.15, 5.338], ["semuanya", 5.4, 5.9], ["berada", 5.963, 6.338], ["tepat", 6.4, 6.713], ["di", 6.775, 6.9], ["garis", 6.963, 7.275], ["setengah.", 7.338, 7.9]]}, {"id": "b2_4", "seg": 2, "scene": "b2", "text": "Kita juga bisa mencoba sendiri dengan beberapa baris kode Python.", "hold": 0.8, "start": 173.45, "speech": 173.85, "audio": 4.062, "dur": 5.562, "words": [["Kita", 0.4, 0.65], ["juga", 0.713, 0.963], ["bisa", 1.025, 1.275], ["mencoba", 1.337, 1.775], ["sendiri", 1.837, 2.275], ["dengan", 2.337, 2.712], ["beberapa", 2.775, 3.275], ["baris", 3.337, 3.65], ["kode", 3.712, 3.962], ["Python.", 4.025, 4.463]]}, {"id": "b2_5", "seg": 2, "scene": "b2", "text": "Lihat, sepuluh nol pertama semuanya punya bagian real nol koma lima.", "hold": 1.5, "start": 179.012, "speech": 179.412, "audio": 4.25, "dur": 6.45, "words": [["Lihat,", 0.4, 0.775], ["sepuluh", 0.838, 1.275], ["nol", 1.337, 1.525], ["pertama", 1.587, 2.025], ["semuanya", 2.087, 2.587], ["punya", 2.65, 2.962], ["bagian", 3.025, 3.4], ["real", 3.462, 3.712], ["nol", 3.775, 3.962], ["koma", 4.025, 4.275], ["lima.", 4.338, 4.65]]}, {"id": "b2_6", "seg": 2, "scene": "b2", "text": "Namun, dalam matematika, triliunan contoh tetap belum termasuk bukti.", "hold": 0.8, "start": 185.462, "speech": 185.862, "audio": 4.312, "dur": 5.812, "words": [["Namun,", 0.4, 0.775], ["dalam", 0.838, 1.15], ["matematika,", 1.212, 1.9], ["triliunan", 1.962, 2.525], ["contoh", 2.587, 2.962], ["tetap", 3.025, 3.337], ["belum", 3.4, 3.712], ["termasuk", 3.775, 4.275], ["bukti.", 4.338, 4.713]]}, {"id": "b2_7", "seg": 2, "scene": "b2", "text": "Kalau ada satu saja nol yang meleset di urutan ke sekian kuadriliun, hipotesis ini runtuh.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 191.274, "speech": 191.674, "audio": 5.625, "dur": 7.325, "words": [["Kalau", 0.4, 0.713], ["ada", 0.775, 0.963], ["satu", 1.025, 1.275], ["saja", 1.337, 1.587], ["nol", 1.65, 1.837], ["yang", 1.9, 2.15], ["meleset", 2.212, 2.65], ["di", 2.712, 2.837], ["urutan", 2.9, 3.275], ["ke", 3.337, 3.462], ["sekian", 3.525, 3.9], ["kuadriliun,", 3.962, 4.65], ["hipotesis", 4.713, 5.275], ["ini", 5.338, 5.525], ["runtuh.", 5.588, 6.025]]}, {"id": "b2_8", "seg": 2, "scene": "b2", "text": "Karena itu, yang dibutuhkan adalah bukti yang berlaku untuk semua nol, bukan hanya nol yang sudah diperiksa.", "hold": 3.5, "start": 198.599, "speech": 198.999, "audio": 6.75, "dur": 10.95, "words": [["Karena", 0.4, 0.775], ["itu,", 0.838, 1.087], ["yang", 1.15, 1.4], ["dibutuhkan", 1.462, 2.087], ["adalah", 2.15, 2.525], ["bukti", 2.587, 2.9], ["yang", 2.962, 3.212], ["berlaku", 3.275, 3.712], ["untuk", 3.775, 4.088], ["semua", 4.15, 4.463], ["nol,", 4.525, 4.775], ["bukan", 4.838, 5.15], ["hanya", 5.213, 5.525], ["nol", 5.588, 5.775], ["yang", 5.838, 6.088], ["sudah", 6.15, 6.463], ["diperiksa.", 6.525, 7.15]]}, {"id": "b3_1", "seg": 3, "scene": "b3", "text": "Klaim ini tidak muncul tiba-tiba, karena sebelumnya AI sudah berlatih dengan soal-soal yang sangat besar.", "hold": 0.6, "lead": 1.2, "start": 209.549, "speech": 210.749, "audio": 6.562, "dur": 8.662, "words": [["Klaim", 1.2, 1.512], ["ini", 1.575, 1.762], ["tidak", 1.825, 2.138], ["muncul", 2.2, 2.575], ["tiba-tiba,", 2.638, 3.263], ["karena", 3.325, 3.7], ["sebelumnya", 3.763, 4.388], ["AI", 4.45, 4.575], ["sudah", 4.638, 4.95], ["berlatih", 5.013, 5.513], ["dengan", 5.575, 5.95], ["soal-soal", 6.013, 6.575], ["yang", 6.638, 6.888], ["sangat", 6.95, 7.325], ["besar.", 7.388, 7.763]]}, {"id": "b3_2", "seg": 3, "scene": "b3", "text": "Pada Agustus dua ribu dua puluh enam, Anthropic mengumumkan bahwa Claude memperbaiki sebuah batas lama. Sebelumnya, hanya empat puluh satu koma enam persen nol zeta yang terbukti berada di garis setengah, dan Claude menaikkannya menjadi enam puluh tujuh koma dua persen.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 218.211, "speech": 218.611, "audio": 16.875, "dur": 18.575, "words": [["Pada", 0.4, 0.65], ["Agustus", 0.713, 1.15], ["dua", 1.212, 1.4], ["ribu", 1.462, 1.712], ["dua", 1.775, 1.962], ["puluh", 2.025, 2.337], ["enam,", 2.4, 2.712], ["Anthropic", 2.775, 3.337], ["mengumumkan", 3.4, 4.088], ["bahwa", 4.15, 4.463], ["Claude", 4.525, 4.9], ["memperbaiki", 4.963, 5.65], ["sebuah", 5.713, 6.088], ["batas", 6.15, 6.463], ["lama.", 6.525, 6.838], ["Sebelumnya,", 6.9, 7.588], ["hanya", 7.65, 7.963], ["empat", 8.025, 8.338], ["puluh", 8.4, 8.713], ["satu", 8.775, 9.025], ["koma", 9.088, 9.338], ["enam", 9.4, 9.65], ["persen", 9.713, 10.088], ["nol", 10.15, 10.338], ["zeta", 10.4, 10.65], ["yang", 10.713, 10.963], ["terbukti", 11.025, 11.525], ["berada", 11.588, 11.963], ["di", 12.025, 12.15], ["garis", 12.213, 12.525], ["setengah,", 12.588, 13.15], ["dan", 13.213, 13.4], ["Claude", 13.463, 13.838], ["menaikkannya", 13.9, 14.65], ["menjadi", 14.713, 15.15], ["enam", 15.213, 15.463], ["puluh", 15.525, 15.838], ["tujuh", 15.9, 16.212], ["koma", 16.275, 16.525], ["dua", 16.587, 16.775], ["persen.", 16.837, 17.275]]}, {"id": "b3_3", "seg": 3, "scene": "b3", "text": "Yang menarik, Claude mencoba sekitar enam ratus lima puluh ide terlebih dahulu, dan semuanya gagal.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 236.786, "speech": 237.186, "audio": 6.188, "dur": 7.888, "words": [["Yang", 0.4, 0.65], ["menarik,", 0.713, 1.212], ["Claude", 1.275, 1.65], ["mencoba", 1.712, 2.15], ["sekitar", 2.212, 2.65], ["enam", 2.712, 2.962], ["ratus", 3.025, 3.337], ["lima", 3.4, 3.65], ["puluh", 3.712, 4.025], ["ide", 4.088, 4.275], ["terlebih", 4.338, 4.838], ["dahulu,", 4.9, 5.338], ["dan", 5.4, 5.588], ["semuanya", 5.65, 6.15], ["gagal.", 6.213, 6.588]]}, {"id": "b3_4", "seg": 3, "scene": "b3", "text": "Ide yang berhasil muncul setelah ratusan kegagalan, persis seperti cara kerja seorang peneliti.", "hold": 0.8, "start": 244.674, "speech": 245.074, "audio": 5.938, "dur": 7.438, "words": [["Ide", 0.4, 0.588], ["yang", 0.65, 0.9], ["berhasil", 0.963, 1.462], ["muncul", 1.525, 1.9], ["setelah", 1.962, 2.4], ["ratusan", 2.462, 2.9], ["kegagalan,", 2.962, 3.587], ["persis", 3.65, 4.025], ["seperti", 4.088, 4.525], ["cara", 4.588, 4.838], ["kerja", 4.9, 5.213], ["seorang", 5.275, 5.713], ["peneliti.", 5.775, 6.338]]}, {"id": "b3_4x", "seg": 3, "scene": "b3", "text": "Dalam proyek itu, Claude memakai sekitar enam puluh subagen, menulis tiga puluh satu juta token, dan menjalankan lebih dari dua ribu perintah di terminal.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 252.112, "speech": 252.512, "audio": 9.625, "dur": 11.325, "words": [["Dalam", 0.4, 0.713], ["proyek", 0.775, 1.15], ["itu,", 1.212, 1.462], ["Claude", 1.525, 1.9], ["memakai", 1.962, 2.4], ["sekitar", 2.462, 2.9], ["enam", 2.962, 3.212], ["puluh", 3.275, 3.587], ["subagen,", 3.65, 4.15], ["menulis", 4.213, 4.65], ["tiga", 4.713, 4.963], ["puluh", 5.025, 5.338], ["satu", 5.4, 5.65], ["juta", 5.713, 5.963], ["token,", 6.025, 6.4], ["dan", 6.463, 6.65], ["menjalankan", 6.713, 7.4], ["lebih", 7.463, 7.775], ["dari", 7.838, 8.088], ["dua", 8.15, 8.338], ["ribu", 8.4, 8.65], ["perintah", 8.713, 9.213], ["di", 9.275, 9.4], ["terminal.", 9.463, 10.025]]}, {"id": "b3_5", "seg": 3, "scene": "b3", "text": "Meski begitu, Anthropic menulis bahwa mereka tidak berharap teknik ini akan membawa ke bukti Hipotesis Riemann.", "hold": 0.8, "start": 263.437, "speech": 263.837, "audio": 6.938, "dur": 8.438, "words": [["Meski", 0.4, 0.713], ["begitu,", 0.775, 1.212], ["Anthropic", 1.275, 1.837], ["menulis", 1.9, 2.337], ["bahwa", 2.4, 2.712], ["mereka", 2.775, 3.15], ["tidak", 3.212, 3.525], ["berharap", 3.587, 4.088], ["teknik", 4.15, 4.525], ["ini", 4.588, 4.775], ["akan", 4.838, 5.088], ["membawa", 5.15, 5.588], ["ke", 5.65, 5.775], ["bukti", 5.838, 6.15], ["Hipotesis", 6.213, 6.775], ["Riemann.", 6.838, 7.338]]}, {"id": "b3_6", "seg": 3, "scene": "b3", "text": "Di proyek lain, tim yang terdiri dari puluhan agen Claude menulis bukti Teorema Terakhir Fermat dalam bahasa Lean.", "hold": 0.8, "start": 271.875, "speech": 272.275, "audio": 7.125, "dur": 8.625, "words": [["Di", 0.4, 0.525], ["proyek", 0.588, 0.963], ["lain,", 1.025, 1.337], ["tim", 1.4, 1.587], ["yang", 1.65, 1.9], ["terdiri", 1.962, 2.4], ["dari", 2.462, 2.712], ["puluhan", 2.775, 3.212], ["agen", 3.275, 3.525], ["Claude", 3.587, 3.962], ["menulis", 4.025, 4.463], ["bukti", 4.525, 4.838], ["Teorema", 4.9, 5.338], ["Terakhir", 5.4, 5.9], ["Fermat", 5.963, 6.338], ["dalam", 6.4, 6.713], ["bahasa", 6.775, 7.15], ["Lean.", 7.213, 7.525]]}, {"id": "b3_7", "seg": 3, "scene": "b3", "text": "Hasilnya sekitar tiga belas juta baris kode dengan lebih dari tiga puluh ribu teorema, dan pekerjaan itu selesai hanya dalam sekitar sebelas hari.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 280.5, "speech": 280.9, "audio": 9.125, "dur": 10.825, "words": [["Hasilnya", 0.4, 0.9], ["sekitar", 0.963, 1.4], ["tiga", 1.462, 1.712], ["belas", 1.775, 2.087], ["juta", 2.15, 2.4], ["baris", 2.462, 2.775], ["kode", 2.837, 3.087], ["dengan", 3.15, 3.525], ["lebih", 3.587, 3.9], ["dari", 3.962, 4.213], ["tiga", 4.275, 4.525], ["puluh", 4.588, 4.9], ["ribu", 4.963, 5.213], ["teorema,", 5.275, 5.775], ["dan", 5.838, 6.025], ["pekerjaan", 6.088, 6.65], ["itu", 6.713, 6.9], ["selesai", 6.963, 7.4], ["hanya", 7.463, 7.775], ["dalam", 7.838, 8.15], ["sekitar", 8.213, 8.65], ["sebelas", 8.713, 9.15], ["hari.", 9.213, 9.525]]}, {"id": "b3_8", "seg": 3, "scene": "b3", "text": "Para agen membagi tugas. Ada yang mendefinisikan konsep, ada yang membuktikan teorema kecil, lalu teorema kecil dipakai untuk membuktikan teorema yang lebih besar.", "hold": 1.5, "start": 291.325, "speech": 291.725, "audio": 10.188, "dur": 12.388, "words": [["Para", 0.4, 0.65], ["agen", 0.713, 0.963], ["membagi", 1.025, 1.462], ["tugas.", 1.525, 1.9], ["Ada", 1.962, 2.15], ["yang", 2.212, 2.462], ["mendefinisikan", 2.525, 3.4], ["konsep,", 3.462, 3.9], ["ada", 3.962, 4.15], ["yang", 4.213, 4.463], ["membuktikan", 4.525, 5.213], ["teorema", 5.275, 5.713], ["kecil,", 5.775, 6.15], ["lalu", 6.213, 6.463], ["teorema", 6.525, 6.963], ["kecil", 7.025, 7.338], ["dipakai", 7.4, 7.838], ["untuk", 7.9, 8.213], ["membuktikan", 8.275, 8.963], ["teorema", 9.025, 9.463], ["yang", 9.525, 9.775], ["lebih", 9.838, 10.15], ["besar.", 10.213, 10.588]]}, {"id": "b3_9", "seg": 3, "scene": "b3", "text": "Cara kerja ini mirip tim pengembang yang membagi proyek besar menjadi banyak fungsi kecil.", "hold": 3.5, "start": 303.713, "speech": 304.113, "audio": 5.625, "dur": 9.825, "words": [["Cara", 0.4, 0.65], ["kerja", 0.713, 1.025], ["ini", 1.087, 1.275], ["mirip", 1.337, 1.65], ["tim", 1.712, 1.9], ["pengembang", 1.962, 2.587], ["yang", 2.65, 2.9], ["membagi", 2.962, 3.4], ["proyek", 3.462, 3.837], ["besar", 3.9, 4.213], ["menjadi", 4.275, 4.713], ["banyak", 4.775, 5.15], ["fungsi", 5.213, 5.588], ["kecil.", 5.65, 6.025]]}, {"id": "b4_1", "seg": 4, "scene": "b4", "text": "Pada dua puluh November dua ribu dua puluh enam, matematikawan Levent Alpöge mengunggah sebuah catatan di situs pribadinya.", "hold": 0.6, "lead": 1.2, "start": 313.538, "speech": 314.738, "audio": 7.688, "dur": 9.787, "words": [["Pada", 1.2, 1.45], ["dua", 1.512, 1.7], ["puluh", 1.762, 2.075], ["November", 2.138, 2.638], ["dua", 2.7, 2.888], ["ribu", 2.95, 3.2], ["dua", 3.263, 3.45], ["puluh", 3.513, 3.825], ["enam,", 3.888, 4.2], ["matematikawan", 4.263, 5.075], ["Levent", 5.138, 5.513], ["Alpöge", 5.575, 5.95], ["mengunggah", 6.013, 6.638], ["sebuah", 6.7, 7.075], ["catatan", 7.138, 7.575], ["di", 7.638, 7.763], ["situs", 7.825, 8.137], ["pribadinya.", 8.2, 8.887]]}, {"id": "b4_2", "seg": 4, "scene": "b4", "text": "Alpöge bekerja di Anthropic, perusahaan yang membuat Claude.", "hold": 0.6, "start": 323.325, "speech": 323.725, "audio": 3.75, "dur": 5.05, "words": [["Alpöge", 0.4, 0.775], ["bekerja", 0.838, 1.275], ["di", 1.337, 1.462], ["Anthropic,", 1.525, 2.15], ["perusahaan", 2.212, 2.837], ["yang", 2.9, 3.15], ["membuat", 3.212, 3.65], ["Claude.", 3.712, 4.15]]}, {"id": "b4_3", "seg": 4, "scene": "b4", "text": "Dalam catatan itu, ia menulis bahwa ia yakin telah menemukan bukti Hipotesis Riemann bersama Claude.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 328.375, "speech": 328.775, "audio": 6.25, "dur": 7.95, "words": [["Dalam", 0.4, 0.713], ["catatan", 0.775, 1.212], ["itu,", 1.275, 1.525], ["ia", 1.587, 1.712], ["menulis", 1.775, 2.212], ["bahwa", 2.275, 2.587], ["ia", 2.65, 2.775], ["yakin", 2.837, 3.15], ["telah", 3.212, 3.525], ["menemukan", 3.587, 4.15], ["bukti", 4.213, 4.525], ["Hipotesis", 4.588, 5.15], ["Riemann", 5.213, 5.65], ["bersama", 5.713, 6.15], ["Claude.", 6.213, 6.65]]}, {"id": "b4_4", "seg": 4, "scene": "b4", "text": "Ia juga menyatakan bahwa metodenya membuktikan versi yang lebih umum, yaitu Hipotesis Riemann yang Diperumum.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 336.325, "speech": 336.725, "audio": 6.812, "dur": 8.512, "words": [["Ia", 0.4, 0.525], ["juga", 0.588, 0.838], ["menyatakan", 0.9, 1.525], ["bahwa", 1.587, 1.9], ["metodenya", 1.962, 2.525], ["membuktikan", 2.587, 3.275], ["versi", 3.337, 3.65], ["yang", 3.712, 3.962], ["lebih", 4.025, 4.338], ["umum,", 4.4, 4.713], ["yaitu", 4.775, 5.088], ["Hipotesis", 5.15, 5.713], ["Riemann", 5.775, 6.213], ["yang", 6.275, 6.525], ["Diperumum.", 6.588, 7.213]]}, {"id": "b4_5", "seg": 4, "scene": "b4", "text": "Bagian yang paling mengejutkan adalah buktinya, yang tidak berupa makalah biasa, melainkan kode Lean yang sangat besar.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 344.837, "speech": 345.237, "audio": 7.438, "dur": 9.138, "words": [["Bagian", 0.4, 0.775], ["yang", 0.838, 1.087], ["paling", 1.15, 1.525], ["mengejutkan", 1.587, 2.275], ["adalah", 2.337, 2.712], ["buktinya,", 2.775, 3.337], ["yang", 3.4, 3.65], ["tidak", 3.712, 4.025], ["berupa", 4.088, 4.463], ["makalah", 4.525, 4.963], ["biasa,", 5.025, 5.4], ["melainkan", 5.463, 6.025], ["kode", 6.088, 6.338], ["Lean", 6.4, 6.65], ["yang", 6.713, 6.963], ["sangat", 7.025, 7.4], ["besar.", 7.463, 7.838]]}, {"id": "b4_6", "seg": 4, "scene": "b4", "text": "Menurut perkiraan matematikawan Thomas Bloom, kalau ditulis dalam bentuk yang bisa dibaca manusia, panjang bukti itu lebih dari dua ratus lima puluh ribu halaman.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 353.975, "speech": 354.375, "audio": 10.125, "dur": 11.825, "words": [["Menurut", 0.4, 0.838], ["perkiraan", 0.9, 1.462], ["matematikawan", 1.525, 2.337], ["Thomas", 2.4, 2.775], ["Bloom,", 2.837, 3.212], ["kalau", 3.275, 3.587], ["ditulis", 3.65, 4.088], ["dalam", 4.15, 4.463], ["bentuk", 4.525, 4.9], ["yang", 4.963, 5.213], ["bisa", 5.275, 5.525], ["dibaca", 5.588, 5.963], ["manusia,", 6.025, 6.525], ["panjang", 6.588, 7.025], ["bukti", 7.088, 7.4], ["itu", 7.463, 7.65], ["lebih", 7.713, 8.025], ["dari", 8.088, 8.338], ["dua", 8.4, 8.588], ["ratus", 8.65, 8.963], ["lima", 9.025, 9.275], ["puluh", 9.338, 9.65], ["ribu", 9.713, 9.963], ["halaman.", 10.025, 10.525]]}, {"id": "b4_7", "seg": 4, "scene": "b4", "text": "Setelah itu, Andrew Sutherland dari MIT mengompilasi ulang kode itu secara independen, dan inti Lean menerimanya hanya dengan tiga aksioma standar.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 365.8, "speech": 366.2, "audio": 9.188, "dur": 10.888, "words": [["Setelah", 0.4, 0.838], ["itu,", 0.9, 1.15], ["Andrew", 1.212, 1.587], ["Sutherland", 1.65, 2.275], ["dari", 2.337, 2.587], ["MIT", 2.65, 2.837], ["mengompilasi", 2.9, 3.65], ["ulang", 3.712, 4.025], ["kode", 4.088, 4.338], ["itu", 4.4, 4.588], ["secara", 4.65, 5.025], ["independen,", 5.088, 5.775], ["dan", 5.838, 6.025], ["inti", 6.088, 6.338], ["Lean", 6.4, 6.65], ["menerimanya", 6.713, 7.4], ["hanya", 7.463, 7.775], ["dengan", 7.838, 8.213], ["tiga", 8.275, 8.525], ["aksioma", 8.588, 9.025], ["standar.", 9.088, 9.588]]}, {"id": "b4_8", "seg": 4, "scene": "b4", "text": "Sutherland menyebutnya sebagai momen bersejarah.", "hold": 0.8, "start": 376.688, "speech": 377.088, "audio": 3.0, "dur": 4.5, "words": [["Sutherland", 0.4, 1.025], ["menyebutnya", 1.087, 1.775], ["sebagai", 1.837, 2.275], ["momen", 2.337, 2.65], ["bersejarah.", 2.712, 3.4]]}, {"id": "b4_9", "seg": 4, "scene": "b4", "text": "Namun, hadiah satu juta dolar dari Clay Mathematics Institute belum diberikan, karena pemeriksaan masih terus berjalan.", "hold": 3.5, "start": 381.188, "speech": 381.588, "audio": 7.438, "dur": 11.638, "words": [["Namun,", 0.4, 0.775], ["hadiah", 0.838, 1.212], ["satu", 1.275, 1.525], ["juta", 1.587, 1.837], ["dolar", 1.9, 2.212], ["dari", 2.275, 2.525], ["Clay", 2.587, 2.837], ["Mathematics", 2.9, 3.587], ["Institute", 3.65, 4.213], ["belum", 4.275, 4.588], ["diberikan,", 4.65, 5.275], ["karena", 5.338, 5.713], ["pemeriksaan", 5.775, 6.463], ["masih", 6.525, 6.838], ["terus", 6.9, 7.213], ["berjalan.", 7.275, 7.838]]}, {"id": "b5_1", "seg": 5, "scene": "b5", "text": "Kalau kamu programmer, kamu pasti tahu bahwa compiler menolak kode yang salah.", "hold": 0.8, "lead": 1.2, "start": 392.826, "speech": 394.026, "audio": 4.875, "dur": 7.175, "words": [["Kalau", 1.2, 1.512], ["kamu", 1.575, 1.825], ["programmer,", 1.887, 2.575], ["kamu", 2.638, 2.888], ["pasti", 2.95, 3.263], ["tahu", 3.325, 3.575], ["bahwa", 3.638, 3.95], ["compiler", 4.013, 4.513], ["menolak", 4.575, 5.013], ["kode", 5.075, 5.325], ["yang", 5.388, 5.638], ["salah.", 5.7, 6.075]]}, {"id": "b5_2", "seg": 5, "scene": "b5", "text": "Lean bekerja dengan cara yang mirip, tetapi yang diperiksa adalah bukti matematika.", "hold": 0.6, "start": 400.001, "speech": 400.401, "audio": 5.188, "dur": 6.487, "words": [["Lean", 0.4, 0.65], ["bekerja", 0.713, 1.15], ["dengan", 1.212, 1.587], ["cara", 1.65, 1.9], ["yang", 1.962, 2.212], ["mirip,", 2.275, 2.65], ["tetapi", 2.712, 3.087], ["yang", 3.15, 3.4], ["diperiksa", 3.462, 4.025], ["adalah", 4.088, 4.463], ["bukti", 4.525, 4.838], ["matematika.", 4.9, 5.588]]}, {"id": "b5_3", "seg": 5, "scene": "b5", "text": "Mari kita lihat contoh kecil, yaitu bukti bahwa dua tambah dua sama dengan empat.", "hold": 2.5, "start": 406.488, "speech": 406.888, "audio": 5.062, "dur": 8.262, "words": [["Mari", 0.4, 0.65], ["kita", 0.713, 0.963], ["lihat", 1.025, 1.337], ["contoh", 1.4, 1.775], ["kecil,", 1.837, 2.212], ["yaitu", 2.275, 2.587], ["bukti", 2.65, 2.962], ["bahwa", 3.025, 3.337], ["dua", 3.4, 3.587], ["tambah", 3.65, 4.025], ["dua", 4.088, 4.275], ["sama", 4.338, 4.588], ["dengan", 4.65, 5.025], ["empat.", 5.088, 5.463]]}, {"id": "b5_4", "seg": 5, "scene": "b5", "text": "Lean memeriksa langkah ini, dan karena benar, muncul tanda centang hijau.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 414.75, "speech": 415.15, "audio": 4.562, "dur": 6.263, "words": [["Lean", 0.4, 0.65], ["memeriksa", 0.713, 1.275], ["langkah", 1.337, 1.775], ["ini,", 1.837, 2.087], ["dan", 2.15, 2.337], ["karena", 2.4, 2.775], ["benar,", 2.837, 3.212], ["muncul", 3.275, 3.65], ["tanda", 3.712, 4.025], ["centang", 4.088, 4.525], ["hijau.", 4.588, 4.963]]}, {"id": "b5_5", "seg": 5, "scene": "b5", "text": "Sekarang kita coba menulis bahwa dua tambah dua sama dengan lima.", "hold": 1.5, "start": 421.013, "speech": 421.413, "audio": 4.062, "dur": 6.263, "words": [["Sekarang", 0.4, 0.9], ["kita", 0.963, 1.212], ["coba", 1.275, 1.525], ["menulis", 1.587, 2.025], ["bahwa", 2.087, 2.4], ["dua", 2.462, 2.65], ["tambah", 2.712, 3.087], ["dua", 3.15, 3.337], ["sama", 3.4, 3.65], ["dengan", 3.712, 4.088], ["lima.", 4.15, 4.463]]}, {"id": "b5_6", "seg": 5, "scene": "b5", "text": "Lean langsung menolak, karena tidak ada satu langkah pun yang bisa membenarkannya.", "hold": 2.5, "start": 427.276, "speech": 427.676, "audio": 5.125, "dur": 8.325, "words": [["Lean", 0.4, 0.65], ["langsung", 0.713, 1.212], ["menolak,", 1.275, 1.775], ["karena", 1.837, 2.212], ["tidak", 2.275, 2.587], ["ada", 2.65, 2.837], ["satu", 2.9, 3.15], ["langkah", 3.212, 3.65], ["pun", 3.712, 3.9], ["yang", 3.962, 4.213], ["bisa", 4.275, 4.525], ["membenarkannya.", 4.588, 5.525]]}, {"id": "b5_7", "seg": 5, "scene": "b5", "text": "Bukti yang besar terdiri dari ribuan teorema kecil seperti ini, dan setiap teorema hanya boleh memakai teorema lain yang sudah diperiksa.", "hold": 1.5, "start": 435.601, "speech": 436.001, "audio": 8.562, "dur": 10.763, "words": [["Bukti", 0.4, 0.713], ["yang", 0.775, 1.025], ["besar", 1.087, 1.4], ["terdiri", 1.462, 1.9], ["dari", 1.962, 2.212], ["ribuan", 2.275, 2.65], ["teorema", 2.712, 3.15], ["kecil", 3.212, 3.525], ["seperti", 3.587, 4.025], ["ini,", 4.088, 4.338], ["dan", 4.4, 4.588], ["setiap", 4.65, 5.025], ["teorema", 5.088, 5.525], ["hanya", 5.588, 5.9], ["boleh", 5.963, 6.275], ["memakai", 6.338, 6.775], ["teorema", 6.838, 7.275], ["lain", 7.338, 7.588], ["yang", 7.65, 7.9], ["sudah", 7.963, 8.275], ["diperiksa.", 8.338, 8.963]]}, {"id": "b5_8", "seg": 5, "scene": "b5", "text": "Kalau satu teorema di tengah salah, semua yang bergantung padanya ikut gagal, persis seperti build yang gagal karena satu modul error.", "hold": 2.0, "start": 446.364, "speech": 446.764, "audio": 8.375, "dur": 11.075, "words": [["Kalau", 0.4, 0.713], ["satu", 0.775, 1.025], ["teorema", 1.087, 1.525], ["di", 1.587, 1.712], ["tengah", 1.775, 2.15], ["salah,", 2.212, 2.587], ["semua", 2.65, 2.962], ["yang", 3.025, 3.275], ["bergantung", 3.337, 3.962], ["padanya", 4.025, 4.463], ["ikut", 4.525, 4.775], ["gagal,", 4.838, 5.213], ["persis", 5.275, 5.65], ["seperti", 5.713, 6.15], ["build", 6.213, 6.525], ["yang", 6.588, 6.838], ["gagal", 6.9, 7.213], ["karena", 7.275, 7.65], ["satu", 7.713, 7.963], ["modul", 8.025, 8.338], ["error.", 8.4, 8.775]]}, {"id": "b5_9", "seg": 5, "scene": "b5", "text": "Karena itu, bukti dua ratus lima puluh ribu halaman tidak perlu dibaca baris demi baris oleh manusia, karena pemeriksanya adalah program kecil di inti Lean.", "hold": 1.5, "start": 457.439, "speech": 457.839, "audio": 9.75, "dur": 11.95, "words": [["Karena", 0.4, 0.775], ["itu,", 0.838, 1.087], ["bukti", 1.15, 1.462], ["dua", 1.525, 1.712], ["ratus", 1.775, 2.087], ["lima", 2.15, 2.4], ["puluh", 2.462, 2.775], ["ribu", 2.837, 3.087], ["halaman", 3.15, 3.587], ["tidak", 3.65, 3.962], ["perlu", 4.025, 4.338], ["dibaca", 4.4, 4.775], ["baris", 4.838, 5.15], ["demi", 5.213, 5.463], ["baris", 5.525, 5.838], ["oleh", 5.9, 6.15], ["manusia,", 6.213, 6.713], ["karena", 6.775, 7.15], ["pemeriksanya", 7.213, 7.963], ["adalah", 8.025, 8.4], ["program", 8.463, 8.9], ["kecil", 8.963, 9.275], ["di", 9.338, 9.463], ["inti", 9.525, 9.775], ["Lean.", 9.838, 10.15]]}, {"id": "b5_10", "seg": 5, "scene": "b5", "text": "Itulah sebabnya Sutherland berani berkata bahwa peluang ada yang janggal di dalam kode itu hampir nol.", "hold": 3.5, "start": 469.389, "speech": 469.789, "audio": 6.375, "dur": 10.575, "words": [["Itulah", 0.4, 0.775], ["sebabnya", 0.838, 1.337], ["Sutherland", 1.4, 2.025], ["berani", 2.087, 2.462], ["berkata", 2.525, 2.962], ["bahwa", 3.025, 3.337], ["peluang", 3.4, 3.837], ["ada", 3.9, 4.088], ["yang", 4.15, 4.4], ["janggal", 4.463, 4.9], ["di", 4.963, 5.088], ["dalam", 5.15, 5.463], ["kode", 5.525, 5.775], ["itu", 5.838, 6.025], ["hampir", 6.088, 6.463], ["nol.", 6.525, 6.775]]}, {"id": "b6_1", "seg": 6, "scene": "b6", "text": "Namun, ada satu jebakan yang sangat dikenal oleh programmer.", "hold": 0.8, "lead": 1.2, "start": 479.964, "speech": 481.164, "audio": 3.75, "dur": 6.05, "words": [["Namun,", 1.2, 1.575], ["ada", 1.637, 1.825], ["satu", 1.887, 2.138], ["jebakan", 2.2, 2.638], ["yang", 2.7, 2.95], ["sangat", 3.013, 3.388], ["dikenal", 3.45, 3.888], ["oleh", 3.95, 4.2], ["programmer.", 4.263, 4.95]]}, {"id": "b6_2", "seg": 6, "scene": "b6", "text": "Bayangkan kamu menulis unit test, dan semua test lulus dengan warna hijau.", "hold": 0.8, "start": 486.014, "speech": 486.414, "audio": 4.625, "dur": 6.125, "words": [["Bayangkan", 0.4, 0.963], ["kamu", 1.025, 1.275], ["menulis", 1.337, 1.775], ["unit", 1.837, 2.087], ["test,", 2.15, 2.462], ["dan", 2.525, 2.712], ["semua", 2.775, 3.087], ["test", 3.15, 3.4], ["lulus", 3.462, 3.775], ["dengan", 3.837, 4.213], ["warna", 4.275, 4.588], ["hijau.", 4.65, 5.025]]}, {"id": "b6_3", "seg": 6, "scene": "b6", "text": "Kalau ternyata test-nya sendiri salah tulis, program yang keliru tetap bisa lulus.", "hold": 2.0, "start": 492.139, "speech": 492.539, "audio": 5.125, "dur": 7.825, "words": [["Kalau", 0.4, 0.713], ["ternyata", 0.775, 1.275], ["test-nya", 1.337, 1.837], ["sendiri", 1.9, 2.337], ["salah", 2.4, 2.712], ["tulis,", 2.775, 3.15], ["program", 3.212, 3.65], ["yang", 3.712, 3.962], ["keliru", 4.025, 4.4], ["tetap", 4.463, 4.775], ["bisa", 4.838, 5.088], ["lulus.", 5.15, 5.525]]}, {"id": "b6_4", "seg": 6, "scene": "b6", "text": "Di Lean, masalah yang sama disebut masalah spesifikasi.", "hold": 0.8, "start": 499.964, "speech": 500.364, "audio": 3.438, "dur": 4.938, "words": [["Di", 0.4, 0.525], ["Lean,", 0.588, 0.9], ["masalah", 0.963, 1.4], ["yang", 1.462, 1.712], ["sama", 1.775, 2.025], ["disebut", 2.087, 2.525], ["masalah", 2.587, 3.025], ["spesifikasi.", 3.087, 3.837]]}, {"id": "b6_5", "seg": 6, "scene": "b6", "text": "Lean hanya menjamin bahwa bukti cocok dengan pernyataan yang ditulis, bukan bahwa pernyataan itu benar-benar Hipotesis Riemann.", "hold": 1.5, "start": 504.902, "speech": 505.302, "audio": 7.938, "dur": 10.138, "words": [["Lean", 0.4, 0.65], ["hanya", 0.713, 1.025], ["menjamin", 1.087, 1.587], ["bahwa", 1.65, 1.962], ["bukti", 2.025, 2.337], ["cocok", 2.4, 2.712], ["dengan", 2.775, 3.15], ["pernyataan", 3.212, 3.837], ["yang", 3.9, 4.15], ["ditulis,", 4.213, 4.713], ["bukan", 4.775, 5.088], ["bahwa", 5.15, 5.463], ["pernyataan", 5.525, 6.15], ["itu", 6.213, 6.4], ["benar-benar", 6.463, 7.15], ["Hipotesis", 7.213, 7.775], ["Riemann.", 7.838, 8.338]]}, {"id": "b6_6", "seg": 6, "scene": "b6", "text": "Matematikawan Kevin Buzzard dari Imperial College mengajukan pertanyaan penting. Apakah teorema di dalam kode Lean itu benar-benar sama dengan Hipotesis Riemann?", "hold": 1.0, "start": 515.04, "speech": 515.44, "audio": 10.062, "dur": 11.763, "words": [["Matematikawan", 0.4, 1.212], ["Kevin", 1.275, 1.587], ["Buzzard", 1.65, 2.087], ["dari", 2.15, 2.4], ["Imperial", 2.462, 2.962], ["College", 3.025, 3.462], ["mengajukan", 3.525, 4.15], ["pertanyaan", 4.213, 4.838], ["penting.", 4.9, 5.4], ["Apakah", 5.463, 5.838], ["teorema", 5.9, 6.338], ["di", 6.4, 6.525], ["dalam", 6.588, 6.9], ["kode", 6.963, 7.213], ["Lean", 7.275, 7.525], ["itu", 7.588, 7.775], ["benar-benar", 7.838, 8.525], ["sama", 8.588, 8.838], ["dengan", 8.9, 9.275], ["Hipotesis", 9.338, 9.9], ["Riemann?", 9.963, 10.463]]}, {"id": "b6_7", "seg": 6, "scene": "b6", "text": "Untuk menjawabnya, ada alat bernama comparator yang membandingkan pernyataan di kode dengan pernyataan resmi, dan hasilnya masih ditunggu.", "hold": 0.8, "start": 526.803, "speech": 527.203, "audio": 8.625, "dur": 10.125, "words": [["Untuk", 0.4, 0.713], ["menjawabnya,", 0.775, 1.525], ["ada", 1.587, 1.775], ["alat", 1.837, 2.087], ["bernama", 2.15, 2.587], ["comparator", 2.65, 3.275], ["yang", 3.337, 3.587], ["membandingkan", 3.65, 4.463], ["pernyataan", 4.525, 5.15], ["di", 5.213, 5.338], ["kode", 5.4, 5.65], ["dengan", 5.713, 6.088], ["pernyataan", 6.15, 6.775], ["resmi,", 6.838, 7.213], ["dan", 7.275, 7.463], ["hasilnya", 7.525, 8.025], ["masih", 8.088, 8.4], ["ditunggu.", 8.463, 9.025]]}, {"id": "b6_8", "seg": 6, "scene": "b6", "text": "Sampai video ini dibuat, belum ada makalah yang lolos peer review, dan Clay Institute belum memberikan keputusan apa pun.", "hold": 3.5, "start": 536.928, "speech": 537.328, "audio": 7.562, "dur": 11.763, "words": [["Sampai", 0.4, 0.775], ["video", 0.838, 1.15], ["ini", 1.212, 1.4], ["dibuat,", 1.462, 1.9], ["belum", 1.962, 2.275], ["ada", 2.337, 2.525], ["makalah", 2.587, 3.025], ["yang", 3.087, 3.337], ["lolos", 3.4, 3.712], ["peer", 3.775, 4.025], ["review,", 4.088, 4.525], ["dan", 4.588, 4.775], ["Clay", 4.838, 5.088], ["Institute", 5.15, 5.713], ["belum", 5.775, 6.088], ["memberikan", 6.15, 6.775], ["keputusan", 6.838, 7.4], ["apa", 7.463, 7.65], ["pun.", 7.713, 7.963]]}, {"id": "b7_1", "seg": 7, "scene": "b7", "text": "Apa pun hasil akhirnya, peristiwa ini menunjukkan cara baru dalam bekerja dengan AI.", "hold": 0.6, "lead": 1.2, "start": 548.691, "speech": 549.891, "audio": 5.25, "dur": 7.35, "words": [["Apa", 1.2, 1.387], ["pun", 1.45, 1.637], ["hasil", 1.7, 2.013], ["akhirnya,", 2.075, 2.638], ["peristiwa", 2.7, 3.263], ["ini", 3.325, 3.513], ["menunjukkan", 3.575, 4.263], ["cara", 4.325, 4.575], ["baru", 4.638, 4.888], ["dalam", 4.95, 5.263], ["bekerja", 5.325, 5.763], ["dengan", 5.825, 6.2], ["AI.", 6.263, 6.45]]}, {"id": "b7_2", "seg": 7, "scene": "b7", "text": "AI bisa mencoba ratusan ide dan menulis jutaan baris, tetapi hasilnya tetap harus diperiksa oleh sesuatu yang bisa dipercaya.", "hold": 0.8, "start": 556.041, "speech": 556.441, "audio": 7.812, "dur": 9.313, "words": [["AI", 0.4, 0.525], ["bisa", 0.588, 0.838], ["mencoba", 0.9, 1.337], ["ratusan", 1.4, 1.837], ["ide", 1.9, 2.087], ["dan", 2.15, 2.337], ["menulis", 2.4, 2.837], ["jutaan", 2.9, 3.275], ["baris,", 3.337, 3.712], ["tetapi", 3.775, 4.15], ["hasilnya", 4.213, 4.713], ["tetap", 4.775, 5.088], ["harus", 5.15, 5.463], ["diperiksa", 5.525, 6.088], ["oleh", 6.15, 6.4], ["sesuatu", 6.463, 6.9], ["yang", 6.963, 7.213], ["bisa", 7.275, 7.525], ["dipercaya.", 7.588, 8.213]]}, {"id": "b7_3", "seg": 7, "scene": "b7", "text": "Di matematika, pemeriksanya adalah Lean. Di pekerjaan kita, pemeriksanya adalah test, code review, dan pemahaman kita sendiri.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 565.354, "speech": 565.754, "audio": 7.875, "dur": 9.575, "words": [["Di", 0.4, 0.525], ["matematika,", 0.588, 1.275], ["pemeriksanya", 1.337, 2.087], ["adalah", 2.15, 2.525], ["Lean.", 2.587, 2.9], ["Di", 2.962, 3.087], ["pekerjaan", 3.15, 3.712], ["kita,", 3.775, 4.088], ["pemeriksanya", 4.15, 4.9], ["adalah", 4.963, 5.338], ["test,", 5.4, 5.713], ["code", 5.775, 6.025], ["review,", 6.088, 6.525], ["dan", 6.588, 6.775], ["pemahaman", 6.838, 7.4], ["kita", 7.463, 7.713], ["sendiri.", 7.775, 8.275]]}, {"id": "b7_4", "seg": 7, "scene": "b7", "text": "Jadi, pesannya sama seperti di video-video kita sebelumnya. Jangan langsung percaya hasil AI, tetapi periksa dengan alat yang tepat.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 574.929, "speech": 575.329, "audio": 8.25, "dur": 9.95, "words": [["Jadi,", 0.4, 0.713], ["pesannya", 0.775, 1.275], ["sama", 1.337, 1.587], ["seperti", 1.65, 2.087], ["di", 2.15, 2.275], ["video-video", 2.337, 3.025], ["kita", 3.087, 3.337], ["sebelumnya.", 3.4, 4.088], ["Jangan", 4.15, 4.525], ["langsung", 4.588, 5.088], ["percaya", 5.15, 5.588], ["hasil", 5.65, 5.963], ["AI,", 6.025, 6.213], ["tetapi", 6.275, 6.65], ["periksa", 6.713, 7.15], ["dengan", 7.213, 7.588], ["alat", 7.65, 7.9], ["yang", 7.963, 8.213], ["tepat.", 8.275, 8.65]]}, {"id": "b7_5", "seg": 7, "scene": "b7", "text": "Klaim ini mungkin akan tercatat sebagai salah satu momen terbesar dalam sejarah matematika, atau mungkin para ahli akan menemukan celahnya.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 584.879, "speech": 585.279, "audio": 8.688, "dur": 10.388, "words": [["Klaim", 0.4, 0.713], ["ini", 0.775, 0.963], ["mungkin", 1.025, 1.462], ["akan", 1.525, 1.775], ["tercatat", 1.837, 2.337], ["sebagai", 2.4, 2.837], ["salah", 2.9, 3.212], ["satu", 3.275, 3.525], ["momen", 3.587, 3.9], ["terbesar", 3.962, 4.463], ["dalam", 4.525, 4.838], ["sejarah", 4.9, 5.338], ["matematika,", 5.4, 6.088], ["atau", 6.15, 6.4], ["mungkin", 6.463, 6.9], ["para", 6.963, 7.213], ["ahli", 7.275, 7.525], ["akan", 7.588, 7.838], ["menemukan", 7.9, 8.463], ["celahnya.", 8.525, 9.088]]}, {"id": "b7_6", "seg": 7, "scene": "b7", "text": "Saya akan memperbarui informasinya di kolom komentar begitu ada hasil pemeriksaan.", "hold": 0.6, "start": 595.267, "speech": 595.667, "audio": 5.125, "dur": 6.425, "words": [["Saya", 0.4, 0.65], ["akan", 0.713, 0.963], ["memperbarui", 1.025, 1.712], ["informasinya", 1.775, 2.525], ["di", 2.587, 2.712], ["kolom", 2.775, 3.087], ["komentar", 3.15, 3.65], ["begitu", 3.712, 4.088], ["ada", 4.15, 4.338], ["hasil", 4.4, 4.713], ["pemeriksaan.", 4.775, 5.525]]}, {"id": "b7_7", "seg": 7, "scene": "b7", "text": "Kalau kamu ingin mencoba Lean sendiri, coba tulis bukti dua tambah dua sama dengan empat, lalu ceritakan hasilnya di komentar.", "hold": 1.0, "start": 601.692, "speech": 602.092, "audio": 7.875, "dur": 9.575, "words": [["Kalau", 0.4, 0.713], ["kamu", 0.775, 1.025], ["ingin", 1.087, 1.4], ["mencoba", 1.462, 1.9], ["Lean", 1.962, 2.212], ["sendiri,", 2.275, 2.775], ["coba", 2.837, 3.087], ["tulis", 3.15, 3.462], ["bukti", 3.525, 3.837], ["dua", 3.9, 4.088], ["tambah", 4.15, 4.525], ["dua", 4.588, 4.775], ["sama", 4.838, 5.088], ["dengan", 5.15, 5.525], ["empat,", 5.588, 5.963], ["lalu", 6.025, 6.275], ["ceritakan", 6.338, 6.9], ["hasilnya", 6.963, 7.463], ["di", 7.525, 7.65], ["komentar.", 7.713, 8.275]]}, {"id": "b7_8", "seg": 7, "scene": "b7", "text": "Naskah video ini disusun dengan bantuan AI, termasuk Claude buatan Anthropic, lalu diperiksa fakta dan disunting manusia.", "hold": 2.5, "start": 611.267, "speech": 611.667, "audio": 7.562, "dur": 10.763, "words": [["Naskah", 0.4, 0.775], ["video", 0.838, 1.15], ["ini", 1.212, 1.4], ["disusun", 1.462, 1.9], ["dengan", 1.962, 2.337], ["bantuan", 2.4, 2.837], ["AI,", 2.9, 3.087], ["termasuk", 3.15, 3.65], ["Claude", 3.712, 4.088], ["buatan", 4.15, 4.525], ["Anthropic,", 4.588, 5.213], ["lalu", 5.275, 5.525], ["diperiksa", 5.588, 6.15], ["fakta", 6.213, 6.525], ["dan", 6.588, 6.775], ["disunting", 6.838, 7.4], ["manusia.", 7.463, 7.963]]}], "total": 622.03}